# ============================================================================
# Policy (2026-06-01): keep ALL source scripts (.py/.sh) and docs
# (.md/.txt/.bib/.tex) in git so the two work machines stay consistent.
# IGNORE only: experiment results, raw datasets, scratch dirs, binaries, caches.
# temp/ and .trash/ are ALWAYS excluded.
# ============================================================================

# --- Python caches / build (not source) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# --- Backups (not canonical scripts) ---
*.backup
*.backup_*
*_backup*.py
*_option*.py
*.bak

# --- Jupyter / IDE / OS ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb
.vscode/
.idea/
/.codex/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Binaries / images / archives / logs / model weights / arrays (not scripts or docs) ---
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.svg
*.pdf
*.zip
*.gz
*.tar
*.tgz
*.7z
*.log
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.npz
*.npy
*.bin
*.csv
*.parquet

# --- Experiment results / raw data / scratch / external refs / paper (NOT in-repo source) ---
results/
dataset/
temp/
.trash/
trash/
legacy/
references/
ResearchProposal/
comparison/results/
docs/report_images/
# paper workspaces (2026-06-13, glob 확장 2026-06-18): paper / paper_gpt / paper_legacy /
# paper-gpt / paper_feedback / paper_feedback_gpt 등 'paper' 로 시작하는 모든 최상위 논문
# 워크스페이스는 로컬 전용 scratch 로 git 추적에서 전부 제외. (정책 변경: 이전엔 paper/ 를
# Phase 게이트마다 commit 했으나 사용자 지시로 전체 ignore. 과거 작업물은 git history 에 보존됨.)
/paper*/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.poe/
__marimo__/

# --- Junk / probe files ---
$LOG
.q*check*
.zzz_probe.txt
